      "path": "src/app/post-restore.ts",
      "content": "This still suppresses every replacement while the local apply is pending, rather than only this tab's database (T8.11-B1). The local operation can be waiting for the lifecycle lock while another tab restores; that tab's broadcast is discarded, and the local operation subsequently returns Conflict/RuntimeNotWritable without ever showing the replacement notice. Identify the local candidate database from the request before applying and filter by that identity, or buffer messages until the result is known. Add coverage for a different database's broadcast during a pending, unsuccessful apply.",
