    },
    {
      "path": "src/app/post-restore.ts",
      "content": "If the trader navigates away while apply is pending, `path` already names the destination when this resolves. AppShell's navigation remains enabled and RestoreFlow does not cancel the apply on unmount, so this records a route with no Restore summary as the summary route. No further path effect runs on completion, leaving the destination using pre-Restore launch state until another navigation. Capture the originating route before awaiting and trigger the rebuild on completion if navigation has already left it; cover this with a deferred apply test.",
